          "value": {
            "kind": "settlement",
            "summary": "A small harbour and salt-working settlement in the Vey Lowlands. Its active waterfront stands inland of the drowned old quay. Certain low tides reveal walls and slippery thresholds. A rebuilt bell house keeps copies of the subscription chest's later rules.",
